### Create Reaction (LIKE)

POST http://localhost:3000/reaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
"postId": 1,
"type": "LIKE"
}

### Create Reaction (DISLIKE)

POST http://localhost:3000/reaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
"postId": 1,
"type": "DISLIKE"
}

### Get Reaction Count for a Post

GET http://localhost:3000/reaction/1

###  React to Another Post

POST http://localhost:3000/reaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
"postId": 2,
"type": "LIKE"
}

###  Get Reaction Count for Post 2

GET http://localhost:3000/reaction/2
